\subsection{Dataset}

The dataset is a collection of news articles from the BBC website. The dataset is divided into two parts: the training set and the test set. The training set contains 1,000 news articles, and the test set contains 100 news articles. Each news article is divided into two parts: the title and the body. The title is the headline of the news article, and the body is the main content of the news article.
